      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/football/barcelona-set-for-big-boost-as-hansi-flick-confirms-return-of-raphinha-frenkie-de-jong-12195717#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
