     <article class="story single" data-beat="cricket">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">CRICKET</span> · Crictracker · 2026-10-16 · editor 9/10 · 2 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Jemimah Rodrigues Appointed Switzerland Tourism Friendship Ambassador</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Jemimah Rodrigues</span> <span>#Switzerland Tourism</span> <span>#Cricket</span> <span>#India</span></div>
       <p>Indian batter Jemimah Rodrigues has been appointed Friendship Ambassador for India by Switzerland Tourism, an announcement made on October 15, 2026, in Bangalore. The appointment was publicised in the presence of Martin Nydegger, Chief Executive Officer of Switzerland Tourism. India is a significant market for Switzerland Tourism, ranking among its top 10 source markets, and this campaign aims to diversify visitor flow.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-16/jemimah-rodrigues-appointed-switzerland-tourism-friendship-a.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The initiative seeks to attract more Indian visitors during the autumn and winter months, thereby reducing the current concentration of travel bookings that typically occur between April and June. The campaign will cover all four seasons, with a particular emphasis on drawing Indian travellers during the cooler periods when the Alpine nation usually sees fewer visitors.</p><p>This ambassadorial role comes as Rodrigues continues her recovery from a significant injury. She sustained a high-grade tear in her right hamstring on August 3, 2026, while representing Southern Brave in The Hundred, an injury that forced her withdrawal from the remainder of that competition. Before her injury, she had scored 143 runs across six innings at a strike rate of 131.19, including consecutive Player of the Match awards.</p><p>Rodrigues expressed her enthusiasm for the appointment, stating, &quot;Representing India has always been something very special to me, and wherever I travel, I carry a little bit of home with me.&quot; She added, &quot;What excites me about this association is the chance to discover Switzerland beyond everything we already know and love about it. I'm looking forward to meeting people, trying new things, exploring different places, and sharing those moments with everyone back home.&quot; The hamstring injury has kept her sidelined from major international tournaments, including the Women's Asia Cup and the Asian Games, and she will also miss India's upcoming T20 International and One Day International series against Zimbabwe. Rodrigues is targeting a return to full fitness in time for India's tour of South Africa later in 2026, her next major international assignment, and has been sharing rehabilitation updates on social media.</p><p>What to watch: Rodrigues' return to international cricket later in 2026.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate and detailed report capturing the ambassadorial appointment, event details, and injury timeline.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/jemimah-rodrigues-appointed-switzerland-tourisms-friendship-ambassador-for-india-4882/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
