       <h1>Mary Millben Alleges George Soros Funds Indian Protests</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>American singer Mary Millben has accused billionaire George Soros of financing protests in India to destabilize Prime Minister Narendra Modi's government. In a video message, Millben criticized Congress leader Rahul Gandhi and Cockroach Janta Party founder Abhijeet Dipke for their roles in the perceived unrest.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-16/mary-millben-alleges-george-soros-funds-indian-protests.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Millben urged young Indians to organize peaceful, patriotic counter-movements in support of the Prime Minister. Dipke dismissed her claims, arguing that foreign nationals should not interfere in India's domestic affairs. Millben contended that movements must offer clear, constructive solutions rather than merely creating chaos.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate and concise summary of the source material.</p>
