      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/assam/nda-wins-34-of-42-silchar-municipal-corporation-seats/article71552428.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
